00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:18.190
solving specific problems that are
sophisticated and hard to do and

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:22.570
sometimes that humans are actually bad
act that's where machine learning comes

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:27.789
in so machine learning is a subset of
artificial intelligence and it's all

00:20:27.789 --> 00:20:35.600
about using computers to find patterns
and data to either classify objects

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:41.150
an image classification to recognize
pictures of dogs from cats from ducks or

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:47.360
for kids or to make predictions like
what I'm talking about today and in

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:52.580
these cases you don't explicitly program
the computer to do these steps you learn

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:57.919
you have the computer learns Baidu being
trained on a set of training data for

00:20:57.919 --> 00:21:05.240
instance so many ways in which machine
learning is implemented is through what

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:11.419
we call artificial neural networks so
artificial neural networks are motivated

00:21:11.419 --> 00:21:16.789
